Protocol:
Name	HCT116
Description	HCT116 was grown in McCoy's 5A (GIBCO) supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum.  It was grown in an atmosphere of 37??C in 5% humidified CO2.  After harvest, cells were washed three times with PBS solution (PBS; 8g/L NaCl, 0.2g/L KCl, 2.9g/L Na2HPO412H2O, and 0.2g/L KH2PO4, pH 7.2) and used in the respective experiments.

Name	DLD1
Description	DLD1 was grown in RPMI 1640 medium (GIBCO, Rockville, MD) supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum. It was grown in an atmosphere of 37??C in 5% humidified CO2.  After harvest, cells were washed three times with PBS solution (PBS; 8g/L NaCl, 0.2g/L KCl, 2.9g/L Na2HPO412H2O, and 0.2g/L KH2PO4, pH 7.2) and used in the respective experiments.

Name	transfection hopx
Description	A full length cDNA of HOPX isoform b was isolated from TE15 cells using RT-PCR with primer sets; 5?f-caccatgtcggcggagaccgcgagcgg-3?f and 5?f-gtctgtgacggatctgcactctg-3?f.  The insert was subcloned into pcDNA3.1D/V5-His-TOPO vector (pcDNA 3.1-HOPX) using a pcDNA3.1 Directional TOPO expression kit (Invitrogen).  The sequence of the subcloned HOPX cDNA was verified by sequencing analysis.  Mock vector with self-ligation (pcDNA3.1-mock) was used as a control.  Cells were transfected using Lipofectamine 2000 (Invitrogen) in OPTI-MEM (Invitrogen) according to the manufacturer?fs instructions.  Stable clones with HOPX or mock were established by G418 (GIBCO) selection.  The expression of HOPX in the cell line was confirmed by RT-PCR and Western blot analysis.

Name	Extraction protocol
Description	Total RNA was used to prepare a biotinylated target cRNA according to the manufacture?fs recommendation (provided by Affymetrix, Santa Clara, CA).  Briefly, 200 ng of mRNA was used to generate first-strand cDNA using T7-linked oligo-(dT) primer.

Name	labeling protocol
Description	After second-strand sysnthesis, the cDNA was subjected to in vitro transcription in the presence of biotinylated uridine triphosphate, using an IVT labeling kit (Affymetrix).

Name	hybridization protocol
Description	Quantitative analyses of the isolated total RNA and synthesized cRNA were conducted by electropherogram (Experion; Bio-rad Laboratories).  The biotinylated cRNA was fragmented and hybridized for 16 h at 45??C with the Human Genome U133 plus 2.0 array (Affymetrix), which contains the oligonucleotide probe set for 54,675 full-length transcripts and expressed sequence tags.

Name	scanning protocol
Description	The arrays were washed, stained with streptavidin-phycoerythrin, and scanned using an Affymetrix Model Fluidics Station 450 and GeneChip Scanner 3000 (Affymetrix).

Name	image analysis protocol
Description	The fluorescence intensity of each probe was quantified using the computer program GeneChip operating software, GCOS version 1.4 (Affymetrix).  Each microarray was subjected to a standard quality control evaluation; the percentage of probe sets reliably detecting (present flag) was between 41 and 45%, and the 3?f/5?f ratio of the GAPDH was <1.25.  All background intensities and noise factors were within the range of 40.10 to 48.40 and 1.20 to 1.70, respectively.

